[{"code":"list_still_used","severity":"error","span":{"file":"Main.beni","start":{"line":27,"col":31},"end":{"line":27,"col":39}},"title":"LIST CHANGED WHILE STILL IN USE","message":"`Main.identity` must return a list it owns, but Cmd.task edits what it returns,\nwhich may be a list it does not own.\n\n27|            ( model, Cmd.map (Cmd.task (λ⊤ → page.errors) identity) ⊤ Response )\n                                 ^^^^^^^^ the function is handed on here\n\nHave the function return a list it owns: a new list, or a copy made with\n`List.copy`.\n\nThis is sharing the checker can see: Cmd.task edits what it returns, which may\nbe a list it does not own."}]
